    ],
    "text": "IT is hereby notified that the following Ministers, who were appointed by HIS EXCELLENCY THE PRESIDENT, in the exercise ofpowers vested in him, by Article 44 (1) (b) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, has in termsof under Article 47 (b) of the Constitution resigned such offices of Ministers :-",
